{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "db414cd16ac5e789337ba25365d1d4ff9326ac9d38693fca96ace6ac85f46de9", "ja": "レコーディングを迎えたジュリアと静香。\r\n歌に熱情を傾けるふたりに、\r\nプロデューサーが与えたユニット名は\r\n『D/Zeal』。収録を前に昂る姿に、\r\nプロデューサーは成功を確信する。", "zh": "茱莉亚与静香再次挑战录音。\n两人对歌唱如此投注热情，\n制作人因而将团体命名为『D/Zeal』。\n看见两人在录音前兴致高昂的模样，\n制作人也坚信一定会成功。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4362587579b9b4804d74f8b255ed760b76ab3c32c61008e1fbcbe36eabe7cd25", "ja": "（そしていよいよ、再レコーディング当日……！）", "zh": "（终于到了重新录音当天……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_06_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f5a389c510bbb0d484057fd646be854075df274e9465f2ced2f4d2b693461ace", "ja": "……静香、ジュリア。\nふたりとも、準備はいいか？", "zh": "……静香、茱莉亚，\n你们准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_06_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "014b1766189f29946efe7cca0f971ea3e02f3f4718f176cf9181887f58cdfc0a", "ja": "ああ、もちろんだ！　早く歌いたくて、\nさっきからうずうずしてるくらいさ。なあシズ？", "zh": "嗯，当然好了！我好想赶快唱歌，\n从刚才就一直坐立难安呢。对吧，静？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_06_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "a81e74737941c483e3a417130ef17321919ffcfbab83b02545b9a79f758d56a9", "ja": "はい。私達はいつでも大丈夫です。\nよろしくお願いします！", "zh": "是的，我们随时都可以开始。\n请多指教了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_06_1004_p", "source_sha256": "562c9d45f6aebabe7f7ea35c8967c591470ffc9ec2c31e905499b36634448ca1", "ja": "……ふたりとも、いい顔だな。結局、きちんと\n歌い込めたのは、今日1日しかなかったけど。", "zh": "……你们俩的表情都很棒呢。\n到头来，只有今天让你们好好练唱过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_06_1005_p", "source_sha256": "37f2170ad226adf1cc299ca33bd17d74793449c64c154fee057d64b7dcc9de57", "ja": "それでも、やりつくしたと感じられるくらいに\n歌い込めたってことか。", "zh": "不过，你们真的练得很认真，\n能让人感受到你们投入了一切。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_06_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "ab22a4c0a570757fe5898e465a3fffeb1cf72a6f6400a88ed27a590f27d3092b", "ja": "まあな。お互い遠慮も何もなし、\nただ全力で自分の歌をぶつけあったわけだし。", "zh": "还好啦，我们只是不再顾虑对方，\n使尽全力唱出自己的歌罢了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_06_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "c73dae5fd86f149185a11e4575d33d063b7c99c4191ae66258957688d6823321", "ja": "ふふっ。途中、練習しているのかケンカしているのか、\nわからなくなりましたけどね。", "zh": "呵呵，唱到中途，\n都不知道是在练习还是在吵架了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_06_1008_p", "source_sha256": "ee537356dd15a367255f6a195c6ce7516fd0250662131040f7014cb18c54cc32", "ja": "（実際、見ていてヒヤヒヤするシーンもあったが……\n何事も無くて良かった……！）", "zh": "（实际上，有好几次都让我捏把冷汗……\n幸好没真的起冲突……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_06_1009_p", "source_sha256": "56d45b5282e5fb14e7b29915eb8a45746f5998bdd387b85440ee35985c1ca8e4", "ja": "じゃあ、あとはその成果をレコーディングで形にする、\nそれだけだな。", "zh": "那么，待会就要把练习的成果录制成形，\n这样就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_06_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "bb5071424b26410553926d63acb68884d84f1966cb95ba46d345a9706acc51b4", "ja": "はい！　……だから、最初のうちにジュリアさんに\n伝えておこうと思います。", "zh": "好的！\n……所以，我要趁开始前先跟茱莉亚说一件事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_06_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "e12f03489387f315d656f4dad2685a64b35a1d87cc097da4fd1c92b2eaf41857", "ja": "ごめんなさい。私、このレコーディングでも\nきっと、お行儀よく出来ません。", "zh": "对不起，待会录音时，\n我一定也会像刚刚那样失礼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_06_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "42f6995f61aab431c47cb878d970e8100523226772b399f43955ba194e929cd9", "ja": "二度目はない真剣勝負のつもりで、\n私のありったけを、ぶつけます……！", "zh": "我会当作是仅只一次的全力对决，\n使出我的浑身解数……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_06_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "eef25547666552fe9a2631640aeb593f0c94b1dc98340bff68b08f3621b4b179", "ja": "……ははっ！\nいいね、最高だシズ！", "zh": "……哈哈！\n不错啊，真是太棒啦，静！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_06_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "d16970e13be8fa7d9d8890397bc79ce21fb2be27db16f1b84788cb685e49be20", "ja": "もちろん受けて立つぜ、その勝負！\nそっちこそ、振り落とされるなよ！", "zh": "我当然也会接下这份挑战！\n你自己才该小心，别被我抛在后头啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_06_1015_p", "source_sha256": "12d61c4b17bc508a2f39e60282c5ac63601fabf2521a8ee730e7ecb9e62728c8", "ja": "（ふたりとも、期待に目を輝かせている。全開の情熱を\nぶつけ合い、受け止め合うことの喜びと期待……）", "zh": "（她们的眼神中充满期待，双方都能全力释放、\n接受对方的热情，从中感到喜悦与期待……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_06_1016_p", "source_sha256": "0b9f96c33b206be201152558766af4cd3024298737c04d8942da8e6c3fa3403c", "ja": "（赤と青の炎。互いに高め合うように燃えあがる\nふたりの情熱が、このユニットの……！）", "zh": "（红色与蓝色的火焰。她们相互激励、\n熊熊燃烧的热情，就是这团体的……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_06_1017", "source_sha256": "4af430be65d8d61e3d396464ef388c672f8448a4419327d49b75dea708aab135", "ja": "ユニット名！", "zh": "团体名称！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_06_2000_p", "source_sha256": "4ddf04c19bdc35d2dbac3e15861f3c8f0426ce094fd73b421cee8c4a6b158fb5", "ja": "……ふたりとも。棚上げにしていた\nユニット名だけど……今、決めたよ。", "zh": "……你们听好，之前搁置的团体名称……\n我现在决定了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_06_2001_015siz", "source_sha256": "a39e8c8c9970d5055dfc4b29bb2ac20e8da616d5ef4c833e08c20d3c5a2ab38d", "ja": "ええっ、今ですか！？", "zh": "什么！？现在吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_06_2002_050jul", "source_sha256": "53cf8169470ac3ba8346a42ba72cf19e1bdffc29596e9f1e4fe1446694c347e6", "ja": "おいおい、これからって時に……ったく。\nそれで？", "zh": "喂喂，你也太会挑时间了……真是的。\n所以是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_06_2003_p", "source_sha256": "248cd737e98a4d28393f3a31e7268fc48148975f8ba1a8002a4b7230ee42d6a3", "ja": "歌にかけるふたりの熱い情熱。\n同じくらい熱くて揺るぎない、相手への信頼。", "zh": "你们两位对歌唱充满炽热的热情，\n对彼此的信赖也同样炽热，坚定不移。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_06_2004_p", "source_sha256": "38c636737912c0278ddb4626116688b136504ce4f611263e82665979f8fc130d", "ja": "歌姫で、デュオで、二つの炎で……。\nそんなふたりのことを、ひとつの言葉にこめて。", "zh": "歌姬、双人组、两团火焰……\n我将你们的元素，汇集成一个词语。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_06_2008_p", "source_sha256": "d5caab9f9776bd05acd00b0fc6f6124a7d6008b697f3c5b0bd5a5fb3df92684f", "ja": "『Zeal』は熱い情熱。それは『D』から始まる\nいろいろな言葉と共にある……。どうだ？", "zh": "『Zeal』就是炽热的热情，\n并且与以『D』开头的许多词汇共存……怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_06_2009_050jul", "source_sha256": "fba64b01c5678b5f92273affc0855b174a212cd11584223cf79b8b5818b90dd3", "ja": "いいね！\n『D/Zeal』……気に入ったぜ！", "zh": "很棒啊！\n『D/Zeal』……我喜欢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_06_2010_015siz", "source_sha256": "2c9f75261881a6e3f32a096eac98512d45643e17b4b67241363bff2a886493ca", "ja": "確かに、{$P$}にしては\nまあまあ、悪くないセンスだと思います。", "zh": "以{$P$}来说，\n品味确实还算不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_06_2011_015siz", "source_sha256": "4b8c22d4e5f9fcfe02b753870b7c639a5d84ea3e306d38777cf62d6232b522fb", "ja": "と、いうか……今の今まで決めてなかったんですね。\nこの後の予定、本当に大丈夫なんですか？", "zh": "等一下……你拖到现在才决定吗？\n接下来的行程真的没有问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_06_2012_p", "source_sha256": "70526c1de4b107fed4fefc04939e729db3e45291d4073c1239543e5833355bff", "ja": "ま、まあ、無理やりなスケジュールを組んだから、\nちょっと大変だけど……今は収録に集中してくれ！", "zh": "这、这个嘛，因为行程本来就很紧凑，\n可能会很赶……不过你们先专注在录音上吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_06_2013_015siz", "source_sha256": "37e0b83d26c51a672145af84b648f1d469f03219d00b25eff40977be83dc0fe6", "ja": "はあ。しょうがないですね……わかりました。", "zh": "唉，真受不了……我明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_06_2014_015siz", "source_sha256": "8d402ab86c0891f037834e155cb4b886e59bf0dde4a894e04916b9e284aab75f", "ja": "必ず、最高の曲にしてみせますから。\n期待して、ちゃんと見ていてくださいね！", "zh": "我们一定会完成最棒的歌曲。\n请你拭目以待吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_06_2015_050jul", "source_sha256": "e70d54c4ecf1ac5d9028f64de7da59a86f6800c89e2652245f7100d1ecefeba8", "ja": "あんたのソウルに、『D/Zeal』の歌を焼きつけて\nやるからな。覚悟しろよ、{$P$}！", "zh": "我们『D/Zeal』的歌声会烙印在你的灵魂中，\n准备接受洗礼吧，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_06_2016_p", "source_sha256": "a6271c6a4dd11f0faae312d83ff35350727f8be19c563601da984f9058de94be", "ja": "ああ、楽しみにしてるよ。\nふたりの歌、俺も全力で受け止めるからな！", "zh": "好，我很期待喔。\n我也会全力接下你们完成的歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_06_2017_p", "source_sha256": "2e9f7ff5fd2e61e6518a4cf834a93cb2fee4e373fe57939e793048b44b299fc8", "ja": "（認め合い、挑み合い、高め合えるふたりだからこそ\nすべてを出せる。そんなふたりの全力の競演……）", "zh": "（她们互相肯定、挑战、激励，正因如此才能\n将实力发挥得淋漓尽致，而她们全力碰撞的对唱……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_06_2018_p", "source_sha256": "b2822c244f95b908b1e958065a80cc6a2fa1def821ee4106b0842eae53369dbc", "ja": "（レコーディングはもちろん、ライブも間違いなく\n盛り上がるだろう。忙しくなりそうだ！）", "zh": "（录音当然不用说，演唱会的气氛肯定也会十分热烈。\n看来之后会很忙了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
